# Smoke test of the real x4mp.dll against hostsim, no server (ctest hostsim.real_dll).
# The DLL is initialised implicitly (no `init` line), ticks 600 frames at 60 Hz (10 s of game frames), is reloaded
# (shutdown + FreeLibrary + LoadLibrary + init) with the stash kept, ticks again and shuts down at the end.
expect-log hello
frame 60Hz 600
reload
expect-log hello
expect-state reloads == 1
frame fast 120
